cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "Cross-Validation Strategies for Multi-Series Time Series Forecasting"
abstract: >-
  Experiment code accompanying the SBPO 2026 paper "On Cross-Validation
  Strategies for Autoregressive Forecasting".  Compares KFold,
  GroupKFold, GroupShuffleSplit, and TimeSeriesSplit for multi-series
  forecasting with global models, under both temporal and group
  generalization, across seven public datasets and five regression
  algorithms.
type: software
